#
# Open Build Service 2.10.34
#

Please read the README.md file for initial installation
instructions or use the OBS Appliance from

  http://openbuildservice.org/download/

The dist/README.UPDATERS file has information for people updating
from a previous OBS release.

========
Bugfixes
========

Frontend:
 * Update rails-html-sanitizer RubyGem to version 1.7.1
   - [GHSA-cj75-f6xr-r4g7] Possible XSS vulnerability with certain configurations of rails-html-sanitizer
 * Update loofah RubyGem to version 2.25.2
   - [GHSA-5qhf-9phg-95m2] Ensure Loofah::HTML5::Scrub.allowed_uri? recognizes numeric character references without semicolons
   - [GHSA-8whx-365g-h9vv] Ensure Loofah::HTML5::Scrub.allowed_uri? recognizes the named character references
   - [GHSA-9wjq-cp2p-hrgf] Ensure that both href and xlink:href attributes on SVG elements like use are restricted to local
